<title>GERMANY: Walter says to pay nine mark dividend.</title>
<headline>Walter says to pay nine mark dividend.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, April 21, Reuter - Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>Dividend (per five mark share) 9.00 marks</p>
<p>Bonus Dividend (per 50 mark share) 3.00 marks</p>
<p>Dividend will be paid after annual general meeting on June 1, 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Walter AG Tuebingen. The firm said it would transfer 23.9 million market to its reserves. It added that it would publish its full-year results on May 16.</p>
</text>
